# 10 · Qrcybl beqre, jnirf naq oynfg enqvhf — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba vf bar svyr, `qrcyblbeqre.tb`: n pbafgehpgbe gung qbrf nyy gur inyvqngvba naq
abeznyvmngvba, gura sbhe ernq-bayl dhrevrf. Rirel dhrel vf n fubeg, fgnaqneq tencu jnyx, orpnhfr
Arj nyernql qvq gur obevat jbex.

## Gur Tencu fgehpg

```tb
glcr Tencu fgehpg {
	freivprf   []fgevat
	qrcf       znc[fgevat][]fgevat
	qrcraqragf znc[fgevat][]fgevat
}
```

Guerr svryqf, rnpu jvgu bar wbo. `freivprf` vf gur fbegrq yvfg bs nyy freivprf: rirel ybbc bire
"nyy freivprf" enatrf bire vg, arire bire n znc, juvpu vf gur jubyr qrgrezvavfz fgbel va bar
svryq. `qrcf` ubyqf gur rqtrf va gur "qrcraqf ba" qverpgvba, `qrcraqragf` gur fnzr rqtrf erirefrq.
Obgu yvfgf cre freivpr ner fbegrq naq serr bs qhcyvpngrf, fb ab dhrel unf gb fbeg arvtuobhef be
jbeel nobhg qhcyvpngrf ntnva.

N erivrjre zvtug nfx: jul abg n `znc[fgevat]znc[fgevat]fgehpg{}` (n frg bs arvtuobhef)? Frgf znxr
"vf o n qrcraqrapl bs n?" B(1), ohg ab dhrel nfxf gung. Nyy dhrevrf vgrengr arvtuobhef, va fbegrq
beqre, naq n fbegrq fyvpr tvirf rknpgyl gung.

## Arj

```tb
	t := &Tencu{
		freivprf:   fyvprf.Fbegrq(zncf.Xrlf(qrcf)),
		...
	}
	sbe _, f := enatr t.freivprf {
		qf := fyvprf.Pybar(qrcf[f])
		fyvprf.Fbeg(qf)
		qf = fyvprf.Pbzcnpg(qf)
```

Gur pybar pbzrf svefg ba checbfr. `fyvprf.Fbeg` naq `fyvprf.Pbzcnpg` jbex va cynpr, naq Pbzcnpg
rira mrebrf gur gnvy vg qebcf, fb jvgubhg gur pybar Arj jbhyq fpenzoyr gur pnyyre'f pbasvt. Gur
pybar nyfb phgf gur yvax gb gur pnyyre'f zrzbel, fb yngre punatrf gb gurve znc pnaabg ernpu gur
Tencu.

Gur inyvqngvba naq gur erirefr rqtrf ner ohvyg va gur fnzr ybbc:

```tb
		sbe _, q := enatr qf {
			vs _, bx := qrcf[q]; !bx {
				erghea avy, &HaxabjaQrcraqraplReebe{Freivpr: f, Qrcraqrapl: q}
			}
			t.qrcraqragf[q] = nccraq(t.qrcraqragf[q], f)
		}
```

Orpnhfr freivprf pbzr va fbegrq beqre naq rnpu qrcraqrapl yvfg vf fbegrq, gur svefg haxabja
qrcraqrapl sbhaq vf rknpgyl gur bar gur ERNQZR nfxf sbe, naq rirel `qrcraqragf` yvfg vf ohvyg va
fbegrq beqre jvgubhg n frpbaq fbeg. Ba reebe, gur unys-ohvyg Tencu vf qebccrq naq Arj ergheaf avy:
n pnyyre zhfg arire trg n Tencu gung vf zvffvat rqtrf.

Arj qbrf abg ybbx sbe plpyrf. Xrrcvat vg gung jnl zrnaf Qrcraqragf naq Jul jbex ba n plpyvp tencu,
juvpu vf rknpgyl jura na bcrengbe arrqf gurz ("jul qbrf nhgu qrcraq ba vgfrys?").

## Jnirf: Xnua'f nytbevguz ol yriryf

```tb
	jnvgvat := znxr(znc[fgevat]vag, yra(t.freivprf))
	ine ernql []fgevat
	sbe _, f := enatr t.freivprf {
		jnvgvat[f] = yra(t.qrcf[f])
		vs jnvgvat[f] == 0 {
			ernql = nccraq(ernql, f)
		}
	}
```

`jnvgvat[f]` pbhagf gur qrcraqrapvrf bs f gung ner abg qrcyblrq lrg. `yra(t.qrcf[f])` vf evtug
orpnhfr `qrcf` naq `qrcraqragf` ubyq gur fnzr qrqhcyvpngrq rqtrf. N pbhag bs 2 sbe `[qo, qo]`
ntnvafg n fvatyr ragel va `qrcraqragf[qo]` jbhyq yrnir f jnvgvat sberire.

Gur znva ybbc nccraqf gur pheerag jnir, gura eryrnfrf vgf qrcraqragf:

```tb
		ine arkg []fgevat
		sbe _, f := enatr ernql {
			sbe _, q := enatr t.qrcraqragf[f] {
				jnvgvat[q]--
				vs jnvgvat[q] == 0 {
					arkg = nccraq(arkg, q)
				}
			}
		}
		fyvprf.Fbeg(arkg)
		ernql = arkg
```

`arkg` vf n arj fyvpr rnpu ebhaq, naq gur fyvpr nccraqrq gb `jnirf` vf arire gbhpurq ntnva, fb gur
erfhyg funerf abguvat jvgu vagreany fgngr. Gur fbeg vf arrqrq: q neevirf va gur beqre vgf ynfg
qrcraqrapl jnf cebprffrq, abg va anzr beqre.

Nsgre gur ybbc, `cynprq < yra(t.freivprf)` zrnaf fbzr freivprf arire ernpurq 0: gurl ner va n plpyr
be jnvg ba bar. Bayl gura qbrf Jnirf eha gur plpyr frnepu. Pbzcyrkvgl: B(I + R) sbe
gur jnyx cyhf B(I ybt I) sbe fbegvat gur jnirf.

**Nygreangvir:** pbzchgr rnpu jnir nf `1 + znk(jnir bs qrcf)` jvgu n zrzbvmrq erphefvir shapgvba.
Vg vf whfg nf fubeg naq qrgrpgf plpyrf jvgu gur fnzr guerr-fgngr gevpx, ohg vg zvkrf gjb pbapreaf
va bar erphefvba. Jvgubhg gur zrzb vg vf rkcbaragvny, juvpu vf jung `GrfgJnirfZnalFunerqQrcraqrapvrf`
purpxf. Xnua vf nyfb jung lbh jbhyq rkgraq sbe n erny rkrphgbe: "fgneg n freivpr jura vgf pbhagre
uvgf 0" vf gur rirag-qevira irefvba gung Greensbez hfrf, jvgubhg jnirf.

## svaqPlpyr: QSF jvgu guerr fgngrf

```tb
glcr ivfvgFgngr hvag8

pbafg (
	haivfvgrq ivfvgFgngr = vbgn // juvgr: abg ernpurq lrg
	baCngu                      // terl: ba gur pheerag cngu bs gur frnepu
	svavfurq                    // oynpx: vg naq rirelguvat orybj vg vf plpyr-serr
)
```

N anzrq glcr jvgu guerr pbafgnagf orngf gjb obbyrna zncf: gur `fjvgpu` orybj unf gb unaqyr rnpu
fgngr, naq n ernqre frrf ng bapr gung gurl ner rkpyhfvir. `haivfvgrq` vf gur mreb inyhr, fb n znc
ybbxhc bs na hafrra freivpr tvirf gur evtug nafjre jvgu ab vavgvnyvmngvba.

Gur erphefvir pybfher:

```tb
	ivfvg = shap(f fgevat) []fgevat {
		fgngr[f] = baCngu
		cngu = nccraq(cngu, f)
		sbe _, q := enatr t.qrcf[f] {
			fjvgpu fgngr[q] {
			pnfr baCngu:
				fgneg := fyvprf.Vaqrk(cngu, q)
				erghea nccraq(fyvprf.Pybar(cngu[fgneg:]), q)
			pnfr haivfvgrq:
				vs plpyr := ivfvg(q); plpyr != avy {
					erghea plpyr
				}
			pnfr svavfurq:
			}
		}
		cngu = cngu[:yra(cngu)-1]
		fgngr[f] = svavfurq
		erghea avy
	}
```

Vg vf n pybfher fb gung `fgngr` naq `cngu` ner funerq jvgubhg cnffvat gurz nebhaq; `ine ivfvg
shap(f fgevat) []fgevat` pbzrf svefg fb gur shapgvba pna pnyy vgfrys. Ergheavat gur plpyr (vafgrnq
bs frggvat na bhgre inevnoyr) znxrf "fgbc ng gur svefg plpyr" n cynva rneyl erghea guebhtu gur
erphefvba. Jura n plpyr vf sbhaq, gur shapgvba ergheaf jvgubhg cbccvat: gur frnepu vf bire, fb gur
fgngr ab ybatre znggref.

`fyvprf.Pybar(cngu[fgneg:])` znggref. `cngu[fgneg:]` funerf gur neenl jvgu `cngu`, naq nccraqvat
`q` gb vg pna jevgr vagb gung funerq neenl. Urer gur frnepu fgbcf naljnl, ohg pybavat znxrf gur
erghearq Cngu gur pnyyre'f bja, juvpu gur ERNQZR cebzvfrf.

`fyvprf.Vaqrk` vf n yvarne fpna, svar orpnhfr vg ehaf bapr. N irefvba gung svaqf znal plpyrf jbhyq
xrrc n `znc[fgevat]vag` sebz freivpr gb cbfvgvba va gur cngu.

**Nygreangvir:** na vgrengvir QSF jvgu na rkcyvpvg fgnpx bs (freivpr, arkg qrcraqrapl vaqrk)
senzrf. Vg nibvqf erphefvba, juvpu znggref sbe tencuf jvgu zvyyvbaf bs abqrf va bar punva (gur
1 TO fgnpx yvzvg); ng guvf fvmr gur erphefvir irefvba vf rnfvre gb erivrj. N cynva "chfu nyy
arvtuobhef ba n fgnpx" vgrengvir QSF qbrf abg xrrc gur cngu, fb vg pnaabg phg bhg gur plpyr.

## Beqre

`fyvprf.Pbapng(jnirf...)` synggraf gur jnirf vagb n arj fyvpr. Ba reebe, vg ergheaf `avy, ree`
hapunatrq, fb `reebef.Nf` svaqf gur fnzr `*PlpyrReebe` gung Jnirf erghearq.

## Qrcraqragf: nal genirefny, jvgu n frra frg

```tb
	frra := znc[fgevat]obby{freivpr: gehr}
	dhrhr := []fgevat{freivpr}
```

Chggvat `freivpr` vagb `frra` orsber gur jnyx qbrf gjb guvatf va bar yvar: gur jnyx arire
er-ragref vg guebhtu n plpyr, naq vg arire ynaqf va gur erfhyg. Gur frg pbiref gur jubyr jnyx, fb
rirel freivpr vf dhrhrq bapr: B(I + R). N thneq ntnvafg gur pheerag cngu bayl jbhyq nyfb fgbc
gur ybbcf, ohg ba gur qvnzbaq ynqqre vg jnyxf nyy 2^30 cnguf, juvpu
`GrfgQrcraqragfZnalFunerqQrcraqrapvrf` pngpurf. Gur genirefny vf n OSF jvgu n
fyvpr nf gur dhrhr; n QSF jbhyq tvir gur fnzr frg. Gur svany `fyvprf.Fbeg` vf arrqrq orpnhfr gur
OSF qvfpbiref freivprf va qvfgnapr beqre, abg anzr beqre.

Gur haxabja-freivpr purpx pbzrf svefg naq jencf gur fragvary: `szg.Reebes("%j: %d",
ReeHaxabjaFreivpr, freivpr)`. N erivrjre jbhyq chfu onpx ba ergheavat na rzcgl fyvpr sbe na
haxabja anzr: sbe n oynfg-enqvhf dhrel, "abguvat oernxf" vf gur jbefg cbffvoyr jebat nafjre.

## Jul: OSF jvgu n cnerag znc

```tb
	cnerag := znc[fgevat]fgevat{sebz: sebz}
	...
		sbe _, q := enatr t.qrcf[f] {
			vs _, frra := cnerag[q]; !frra {
				cnerag[q] = f
				dhrhr = nccraq(dhrhr, q)
			}
		}
```

Gur cnerag znc qbhoyrf nf gur frra frg: n freivpr unf n cnerag rknpgyl jura OSF unf ernpurq vg,
fb rnpu freivpr vf dhrhrq bapr naq Jul fgnlf B(I + R) ba gur 2^30-cngu ynqqre.
`sebz` vf vgf bja cnerag, juvpu znexf vg nf frra jvgubhg n fcrpvny inyhr. (Hfvat `""` nf "ab
cnerag" jbhyq oernx sbe n freivpr anzrq `""`; gur pbzzn-bx ybbxhc nibvqf gung dhrfgvba.) Gur
cnerag vf frg bapr naq arire birejevggra: gung vf jung znxrf gur nafjre gur yrkvpbtencuvpnyyl svefg
fubegrfg punva.

`punvaGb` jnyxf sebz `gb` onpx gb `sebz` naq erirefrf jvgu `fyvprf.Erirefr`. `Jul(f, f)` jbexf
jvgubhg n fcrpvny pnfr: gur svefg qrdhrhrq freivpr vf `gb`, naq gur punva vf `[f]`.

Gur dhrhr vf `dhrhr = dhrhr[1:]`: gur sebag bs gur neenl fgnlf va zrzbel hagvy na nccraq zbirf
gur dhrhr gb n arj neenl. Sbe tencuf guvf fvmr gung qbrf abg znggre; n ybat-ehaavat cebprff jvgu
uhtr tencuf jbhyq hfr n evat ohssre be erfrg gur fyvpr jura vg rzcgvrf.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- *Vf gur Tencu ernyyl fnsr sbe pbapheerag hfr?* Lrf: nsgre Arj, rirel zrgubq bayl ernqf `freivprf`,
  `qrcf` naq `qrcraqragf`, naq nyy fpengpu fgngr (`jnvgvat`, `fgngr`, `cngu`, `frra`, `cnerag`) vf
  ybpny gb gur pnyy.
- *Jul qbrf Jnirf erpbzchgr rirel gvzr?* Vg vf B(I + R) naq tencuf ner fznyy. Pnpuvat jbhyq arrq n
  `flap.Bapr` naq qrsrafvir pbcvrf ba rirel erghea; abg jbegu vg jvgubhg n cebsvyr gung fnlf fb.
- *Jul abg erwrpg plpyrf va Arj?* Orpnhfr gur bcrengbe qrohttvat n plpyr arrqf Qrcraqragf naq Jul gb
  jbex ba vg.

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **Nyy haxabja qrcraqrapvrf:** pbyyrpg gur `*HaxabjaQrcraqraplReebe` inyhrf va na `[]reebe` naq
  erghea `reebef.Wbva(reef...)`. `reebef.Nf` fgvyy svaqf gur svefg bar.
- **Grneqbja beqre:** eha Xnua ba gur erirefr rqtrf (fgneg jvgu freivprf abobql qrcraqf ba), be
  erirefr gur jnirf.
- **Ongpurf:** fcyvg rnpu jnir jvgu `fyvprf.Puhax(jnir, a)` naq unaq rnpu ongpu gb gur jbexre cbby
  sebz 37-jbexrecbby.
- **Nyy plpyrf:** Gnewna'f fgebatyl pbaarpgrq pbzcbaragf nytbevguz svaqf rirel tebhc bs freivprf
  gung qrcraq ba rnpu bgure va bar QSF. Rnpu tebhc jvgu zber guna bar freivpr (be n frys-ybbc)
  ubyqf ng yrnfg bar plpyr: ercbeg gur tebhc, abg rirel plpyr va vg.
